`F38f`!TechInc Mesh BBS`!`f  `F888//`f  `!About TechInc`!
========================================================

>Technologia Incognita

`!TechInc`! (Technologia Incognita) is a non-profit hackerspace in
Amsterdam -- an association run by and for its members, funded by
member donations. Open hardware and software, electronics, 3D
printing, lasercutting, lockpicking, amateur radio, biohacking,
and whatever members drag through the door.

>Where

`F888Address `f: Louwesweg 1, 1066 EA Amsterdam            [EDIT]
`F888Building`f: ACTA (the old dental faculty)
`F888Grid    `f: JO22KJ                                    [EDIT]

>When

`F888Open evening`f : `!Wednesday`! from 19:30 till late   [EDIT]
Everyone welcome -- members, guests, expats, visiting hackers.
Outside Wednesday it is "open when it is open"; check the
space-status graphs on the site before travelling.

>Get involved

Drop by on a Wednesday, say hi, have a look around. If you want
to become a member, ask someone at the space or mail the board.

`F888Web    `f: `[www.techinc.nl`https://www.techinc.nl]
`F888Wiki   `f: `[wiki.techinc.nl`https://wiki.techinc.nl]
`F888E-mail `f: network@techinc.nl                         [EDIT]
`F888Chat   `f: #techinc on hackint (IRC), bridged to Matrix   [EDIT]

